Metrics Exported:
================================================================================
Prometheus Metrics:
1. armorclaw_sidecar_requests_total (Counter)
   Description: Total number of requests received by the sidecar

2. armorclaw_sidecar_request_errors_total (Counter)
   Description: Total number of request errors

3. armorclaw_sidecar_request_duration_seconds (Histogram)
   Description: Request duration in seconds
   Buckets: [0.005, 0.01, 0.025, 0.05, 0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 1.0, 2.5, 5.0]

Security Features:
================================================================================
1. Token Validation:
   - Extracts token from gRPC metadata
   - Validates HMAC-SHA256 signature
   - Checks token expiration (30 min TTL)
   - Checks timestamp age (< 5 minutes)
   - Rejects invalid tokens with UNAUTHENTICATED status

2. Request Logging (Safe):
   - Logs: operation, request_id, timestamp
   - Does NOT log: token value, signature, or any sensitive data
   - Log levels: debug (details), info (authorized), warn (rejected), error (HMAC)

3. Metrics Collection:
   - Tracks all requests (success and failure)
   - Measures request latency
   - No sensitive data in metrics
   - Prometheus format for standard monitoring

4. Configuration:
   - Shared secret from environment: ARMORCLAW_SIDECAR_SHARED_SECRET
   - Registry-based metrics registration
   - Arc-wrapped shared secret for thread-safe sharing

